# The gameplay audit's area 4: office - cabinet formation, confidence votes, early elections, caretaker government, term limits, opposition play,
# losing and regaining power, game over (docs/audit/AUDIT_PROTOCOL.md). With area 3's runs this covers the full cross country x role x outcome
# (win, loss, hung or coalition, no confidence or early election, term limit, game over) where the inventory finds the cell reachable; the rest
# are named unreachable with their reason (docs/audit/AUDIT_INVENTORY.md, the outcome cells). Leads: inventory C §6-§7, A Annex C.
#
# --- Sweden: every role, and the moves that end a government ---
